# Nethergoyf's escape cost exiles any number of other cards from its owner's graveyard with four or more card types among
# them. Wheel of Fortune discards a Nethergoyf, Lightning Bolt (instant), Ponder (sorcery), Fabled Passage (land) and
# Black Lotus (artifact); next turn Nethergoyf escapes from the graveyard, exiling the four others. Only the Wheel
# (a sorcery) is left in the graveyard, so it is a 1/2.

